  "decisions": [
    "Kept the two beginner routes in AI foundations; preserved the existing browser-ai courses and locked legacy packages.",
    "Removed the unpublished repetitive sixth practical unit; consolidated the independent deliverable into the fifth unit. The original design rejection remains in editorial-review.json and curriculum.json.",
    "Rejected the first opening review, revised it, and obtained a subsequent no-blocking review; failed reviews below remain preserved rather than relabeled.",
    "Re-opened the Library of Congress primary page, distinguished announced arrangements from verified delivery, and revised six lessons through the existing course CLI after Writer, Polisher and Detector stages.",
    "Fixed a raw internal source handle in one activity brief without altering its reasoning engine or facts."
  ],
